<div>
    <h3>本科生院扎实开展树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-04-15 08:55:19<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 33062)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}</style><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">自</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">启动</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">以来，院党委高度重视、系统谋划、精心组织，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第一时间召开</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">党委（扩大）会议</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">安排</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学习教育</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">相关工作</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">结合实际制定了学习教育实施方案</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">和专题读书班方案，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">扎实有序推进学习教育</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">院党委</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">为全体党员配发《习近平关于树立和践行正确政绩观论述摘编》等学习材料，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">班子</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">成员现已开展6次读书班集体学习，</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各支部相继以领学、研讨、专题党课等方式跟进理论学习，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">组织师生党员前往秦岭违建警示教育基地实地研学</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">院党委以党建专题会议形式聚焦人才培养核心问题开展研讨，不断增强各部门教职工全面提升人才自主培养质量、全面提升服务国家重大战略能力的使命感和责任感。实施科级干部轮训，推动学习教育与业务提升深度融合，持续增强科级干部的政治素养、业务能力和管理水平。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">推进政策制度评估年度集中立项，修订</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院岗位职责白皮书。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">组织辅导员、班主任结合生动育人实践开展“育人故事联讲”7次、</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">“用心用情做好学生工作”专题工作沙龙研讨3期，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; color: black; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">并指导学生党支部开展“梦想与行动”大讨论，进一步凝聚“学生成长成才是最大政绩”的思想共识。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">下一步，院党委将持续深化开展树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育，坚持及时跟进学习，强化以学促干，将学习教育同工作任务紧密结合，以推动高质量发展的实绩检验学习教育成效。</span></p></article></section><p><br></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
